{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Neural: Forbidden</u></i></strong> is a first-person indie horror and puzzle game created by a single developer. You play as Natasha, a girl who wakes up in a gloomy place she doesn\u2019t recognize at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/b5e5761cad11b7b1bf03bd4775a7ef5f.poster.avif?t=1762248480\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/b5e5761cad11b7b1bf03bd4775a7ef5f.webm?t=1762248480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Is that her father\u2019s voice? What lies hidden deep within that senseless and dangerous place? It feels as if she\u2019s still dreaming. You are seemingly alone, with only a camera as your source of light\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/7a08e299a761f09e8c245cc6109e120d.poster.avif?t=1762248480\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/7a08e299a761f09e8c245cc6109e120d.webm?t=1762248480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/7a08e299a761f09e8c245cc6109e120d.mp4?t=1762248480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Embark on this short horror experience to uncover what lies beneath.</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Help the protagonist unravel the mystery and uncover the truth behind it all...\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game aims to create an oppressive atmosphere and an immersive sound design to deliver a short but intense experience focused on psychology and personal discovery, with plot twists that will chill your blood.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/e24509065b02b450aa744280429cf1bc.poster.avif?t=1762248480\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/e24509065b02b450aa744280429cf1bc.webm?t=1762248480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/e24509065b02b450aa744280429cf1bc.mp4?t=1762248480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>For lovers of puzzles and enigmatic stories, the game blends different camera perspectives alongside first-person moments, creating scenes designed to chill and disturb you.</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Approximate duration: 1 hour.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This first- and third-person horror experience includes puzzle elements and a narrative featuring experienced voice actors.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developed in Argentina.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/1bffe4d0e06d165b230cb694032d2300.poster.avif?t=1762248480\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/1bffe4d0e06d165b230cb694032d2300.webm?t=1762248480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4096020?t=1762248480","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/0ae19d03dee821d9e5d3f12c1c178f3c198b304d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762248480","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/0e931c889063af85eb3fa6c17e16e4b5996f272d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762248480","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/0e931c889063af85eb3fa6c17e16e4b5996f272d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762248480","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game does not contain sexual content or depictions of sex. However, it includes sensitive themes involving psychological and emotional abuse, family trauma, and mental health, which may be disturbing to some players."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Neural: Forbidden</u></i></strong> is a first-person indie horror and puzzle game created by a single developer. You play as Natasha, a girl who wakes up in a gloomy place she doesn\u2019t recognize at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/b5e5761cad11b7b1bf03bd4775a7ef5f.poster.avif?t=1762248480\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/b5e5761cad11b7b1bf03bd4775a7ef5f.webm?t=1762248480\" type=\"video/webm;